## Product Development Roadmap

### **MVP (Months 1-3): Foundation**

#### **Core Features**
- Prompt-to-Slides Engine
  - Natural language processing for presentation requirements
  - Context understanding across slide sequences
  - Template selection (3 core templates)

#### **Essential Templates**
- Pitch Deck (12 slides): Problem, solution, market, traction, team, financials
- Board Meeting (8 slides): KPIs, updates, challenges, decisions
- Team Meeting (6 slides): Goals, progress, announcements

#### **Basic Slide Types**
- Title slides with dynamic layouts
- Content slides (bullet points, text blocks)
- Simple charts (bar, line, pie) with Chart.js
- Image + text combinations with AI-generated visuals

#### **Native Presentation Mode**
- Full-screen slide navigation
- Keyboard controls and presenter notes
- Progress indicators and slide counter

#### **Technical MVP Requirements**
- E2B sandbox integration for AI processing
- Supabase backend for user management
- Export functionality (PDF, PNG, shareable links)
- Basic responsive design

