## Business Model & Monetization

### **Pricing Strategy**
- **Freemium Model**
  - Free Tier: 3 presentations/month, basic templates, Slidable watermark
  - Pro ($15/month): Unlimited presentations, all templates, no watermark, PDF export
  - Team ($45/month): 5 users, collaboration features, brand customization
